{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/extras/326884cdff4bf3d2e3124ccc8566460e.avif?t=1755018929\" width=1364 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a cultivation game. Combining the cultivation system with the traditional Chinese cultural background, experience the process of growing from a mortal to a strong person step by step, and fight against various demons and beasts in the cultivation system. Can you stick to your heart and fight against difficulties; Be cautious in making choices and grasp your own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit teammates in the tavern. Interacting with scattered cultivators in the tavern, please have a drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auctions can auction various precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manage your own dojo and build various buildings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755440?t=1755018929","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/a4731b3f8fdcb0d7e73f1d56f864b5be4ceac671/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755018929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/0bfd50b3bd17452a6556f321a553b4b796945461/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755018929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/0bfd50b3bd17452a6556f321a553b4b796945461/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755018929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/extras/326884cdff4bf3d2e3124ccc8566460e.avif?t=1755018929\" width=1364 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a cultivation game. Combining the cultivation system with the traditional Chinese cultural background, experience the process of growing from a mortal to a strong person step by step, and fight against various demons and beasts in the cultivation system. Can you stick to your heart and fight against difficulties; Be cautious in making choices and grasp your own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit teammates in the tavern. Interacting with scattered cultivators in the tavern, please have a drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auctions can auction various precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manage your own dojo and build various buildings.</p>","developers":["\u8001\u7389\u7c73"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/291e6d1979bf5b50c8a8f687774e23fd2b6336c3/header.jpg?t=1755018929","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257174475,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174475/movie480.mp4?t=1754796623","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174475/movie_max.mp4?t=1754796623"},"name":"The Legend of Fortune and Immortality","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174475/3584172183a34636ff858d8fd2d40a65cba09258/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754796623","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174475/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754796623","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174475/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754796623"}}],"name":"The Legend of Fortune and Immortality","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows</li